  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Come relax at our treasured family beach house - a truly comfortable coastal getaway only 2 minutes’ walk to one of 3 unique community beach boardwalks and public boat/jet ski launch. We offer 1,386 sq ft with 4 bedrooms, 2 Jack-n-Jill bathrooms, an open family room, dining room & full kitchen, as well as a bonus Florida room; front and back decks with an additional open upper deck with a beautiful ocean view. Our vacation amenities include Wi-Fi, gas grill, picnic table, outdoor shower, washer, dryer, and all the furnishings that make this cherished beach home most inviting. Inlet Beach is South Walton County's jewel situated between Rosemary Beach and Camp Helen State Park; just 5 minutes away from 30A shops, restaurants and venues to the west & 5 minutes from Panama City Beach to the east. PLEASE NOTE: Limit 1 dog 20 lbs or less. <br>A pet fee of $250 will be added to the total cost of your stay with us.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
